   },
   "list1": {
    "type": {
     "resolvedName": "Paragraph"
    },
    "nodes": [],
    "props": {
     "text": "<ul><li><p>✓ What warm-up activities are and <strong>why they matter</strong></p></li><li><p>✓ <strong>Different types of warm-up exercises</strong> — from energizers to mindfulness moments</p></li><li><p>✓ How warm-ups can improve <strong>concentration, motivation, and engagement</strong></p></li><li><p>✓ Real-life examples you can start using immediately, whether you're in class, running a business, or working alone</p></li></ul><p></p>",
     "color": "#374151",
     "fontSize": 15,
     "className": "font-inter",
     "textAlign": "left",
     "fontWeight": "normal",
     "lineHeight": "relaxed"
    },
    "custom": {},
    "hidden": false,
    "isCanvas": false,
    "displayName": "Paragraph",
    "linkedNodes": {}
   },
   "list2": {
    "type": {
     "resolvedName": "Paragraph"
    },
    "nodes": [],
    "props": {
     "text": "<ul><li><p>✓ <strong>Watch the course video carefully</strong> — I'll be walking you through the concepts with real-life examples.</p></li><li><p>✓ <strong>Read the course material</strong> — it goes deeper into the 'why' and gives you extra insight you might not catch in the video.</p></li><li><p>✓ <strong>Don't skip the quiz</strong> — it's not just a test; it's a learning tool. The questions are designed to help you reflect and remember.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
     "color": "#374151",
     "fontSize": 15,
     "className": "font-inter",
     "textAlign": "left",
     "fontWeight": "normal",
     "lineHeight": "relaxed"
    },
    "custom": {},
    "hidden": false,
    "isCanvas": false,
    "displayName": "Paragraph",
    "linkedNodes": {}
   },
   "para1": {
    "type": {
     "resolvedName": "Paragraph"
    },
    "nodes": [],
    "props": {
     "text": "Before diving deep into any learning or working session, it's crucial to <em>prepare your mind and body</em> — just like an athlete would stretch before a game. That's exactly what warm-up activities are for. They help you focus, be creative, and prepare to make the most of your day or learning experience.",
     "color": "#374151",
     "fontSize": 16,
     "className": "font-inter",
     "textAlign": "left",
     "fontWeight": "normal",
     "lineHeight": "relaxed"
    },
    "custom": {},
    "hidden": false,
    "isCanvas": false,
    "displayName": "Paragraph",
    "linkedNodes": {}
   },
   "para2": {
    "type": {
     "resolvedName": "Paragraph"
    },
    "nodes": [],
    "props": {
     "text": "Reading and watching together will give you the full picture — and help you succeed not only in this course but in whatever you apply this knowledge to.",
     "color": "#374151",
     "fontSize": 16,
     "className": "font-inter",
     "textAlign": "left",
     "fontWeight": "normal",
